{"id":"u-9b0d7158-246f-44d8-bd7e-b6a8e6060d43","src":"community","title":"Getting started.","author":"Punakuu","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/getting-started-19","desc":"This is a starter program. \n\nProgram start with two gym days per week and then progres to three times per week.\n\nRemember to leave atleast one rest day between gym days!\n\nExample routines: \nTuesday, Friday\nMonday, Wednesday, Friday.\n\nMain movements are back squat, bench press and pendlay row. \n\nProgression:\n\nPick the weight you are comfortable with and leave room for growth. You should aim to increase weight by 2,5kg each time you go to gym.\n\nAim to have rest time of 2-3 minutes per work set.\n\nWhen you hit the platou on weights and cannot increase weight three times in row, lower weight by 10% and begin to increase weight once per week. \n\nWarm up:\n\nRemember to have proper warm up before working sets! For example do 15 minutes of bike riding or rowing machine. You can also use resistance bands for warming up.\n\nNutrition:\n\nAim to eat daily atleast 1g of protein per bodymass/kg (if you weight 100kg eat 100g of protein daily). For example eat chicken/beef and/or eggs and drink some milk daily and you will be fine.\n\nDrink 2-3 liters of water/fluids daily. Your muscles need it in order to function well. Exelent way to start a day is with half a litre of water with multivitamin tablet.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":24,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-22T21:54:52.465Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pendlay Row","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Russian Twist","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Paused)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":